  "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we perform the operation inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{2}÷(7+5) & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}÷12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5}{2}÷12 & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}÷\\frac{12}{1} & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{12} & = \\\\ \\frac{5\\times 1}{2\\times 12} & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{24}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
